  "vibe": "Pond #14262b — a deep teal-black — with koi orange #f07d3c, jade #3f8c7a and gold #d9b45c as the only bright things in it. Gelasio's readable serif keeps titles in the case they were written, up to 148px; Kumbh Sans handles labels. The world is a stocked pond seen from above: three koi in orange, white and gold swimming continuous elliptical orbits at different radii and speeds, tails wiggling six times a second, the lead fish carrying a dark spot; ripple rings opening on the surface; three jade lily pads rocking on a slow sine; and one orange petal spinning as it drifts diagonally across the whole frame. Cards are 22px-round, chips are pills. Beats: a twelve-tick clarity ring, a scrolling pond census, side-sliding garden notes, words cross-fading into each other.",
